			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介/02-用多個處理器同時處理多個 process.png",
			"x": -220,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 398,
			"height": 67
		},
		{
			"id": "8634d7ca21ea3848",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 用多個處理器同時處理多個 process\n- 單一個程式碼再多個處理器中執行",
			"x": 260,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 361,
			"height": 61,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "f2622dc4871f34f3",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介/03-計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介.png",
			"x": -220,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 129
		},
		{
			"id": "11cf105738ef536a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 單一晶片裡面有多顆處理器那也叫做 multicore microprocessors\n- Multicore microprocessor 就是多個 chip 裡面都有多顆的 processor 那麼 moden 都是這樣",
			"x": 260,
			"y": 109,
			"width": 361,
			"height": 151,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "8f356f1df552a42a",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介/04-計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介.png",
			"x": -220,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 106
		},
		{
			"id": "ca6d14b77723d49e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "那麼可以用 Cluster 去做處理，那麼使用 local network 去做連接很多個 computers",
			"x": 260,
			"y": 371,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "170a7e2cd443c399",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介/05-計算機組織_TOPIC_01_多處理器系統簡介.png",
			"x": -220,
			"y": 580,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 179
		},
		{
			"id": "da669eaaf4bc8eff",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 如果軟體應用程式可以被分成多個小的那就叫作 Concurrent 在 runtime 的時候。\n- 硬體如果只有一顆 CPU 就是 Serial 如果多個就叫做 Parallel。",
			"x": 260,
			"y": 609,
			"width": 358,
			"height": 121,
			"color": "1"
		}
	],
